{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "88031126fa39a8f71a263a859c66e742711b3adcdd225c3cd3f80eb75075c85c", "ja": "（今日は紗代子の、新曲のPV撮影をしている。\n撮影は順調。予定より早く休憩に入った……）", "zh": "（今天正在拍摄紗代子的新歌PV。\n拍摄进展顺利，比预定时间更早进入了休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7992c6eb8d94347465ad43df10de5cd4ace9968329a662039762bb3827b45b29", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n監督が紗代子の演技を褒めてたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n导演夸你的演技很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "462af212b7983986a02a462eee2bbbdc503c22f2d74f579c70ee4807c1f02c41", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかった～。撮影にむけて、\nいっぱいレッスンしてきた甲斐がありました！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～。为了拍摄一直努力上课，真是没有白费！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1003_p", "source_sha256": "16d6cb762c2342419d0c3892d6962d97570b7f3b1b253ae7153dc6036b923220", "ja": "ああ。早めに進行してるのは、そのおかげかもな。\n次は難しいシーンだけど、この調子で頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯。进展得这么顺利，可能多亏了这个吧。\n接下来是很难的场景，但就照这个势头继续努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "cced322b4631c7f71f3e912f0ae023eb8e0a14530f9f82633c16d043dd8163c5", "ja": "はい！　次は、涙を流す大事なシーンなので、\n全力でやらないと……！", "zh": "好的！接下来是要流泪的重要场景，所以必须全力以赴才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6d2906b41e98cf5997da0444ad74db02746448a57d286a1fc8518567b44ff6ee", "ja": "あっ。スタッフさんに、目薬を使うか聞かれたけど。\nどうする、紗代子？", "zh": "啊，工作人员问我要不要用眼药水。  \n怎么办，纱代子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "ca5e73ebad80278bf872d5d7e9246e5da897a598c1f86e7a4e6047b583e10625", "ja": "そのことなんですけど……。\n{$P$}。私、目薬は使いません！", "zh": "关于那件事……  \n{$P$}。我不用眼药水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2dfe9850d52ea543beb5ab9871ae0935d7b11d8dfd86155dbdd5ce2b0b4c8e2d", "ja": "そうか。でも本当に大丈夫か？\n今日までずっと、どうするか悩んでただろう。", "zh": "这样啊。不过真的没问题吗？\n你直到今天，一直都在苦恼该怎么办吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "2c7da7d306ea7ecb0a836033889764dfa6dbac474285196ad7252e5b0929cc19", "ja": "はい……。もし涙がでなかったらって思うと不安で。\nでも本物の方が、絶対にいいっていうのもわかります！", "zh": "是……一想到万一流不出眼泪，就觉得很不安。\n不过，我也明白，真实的眼泪绝对更好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "d6f3d7d99802ac1a8138a672ef45b8c930321e5558166d0206294d804a98a121", "ja": "どうしようって悩んでる時に、\nふとアイドルになる前のことを思い出したんです。", "zh": "在烦恼该怎么办的时候，\n我突然想起了成为偶像之前的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "cfa6c2dc6b591499c969a3a8d98816cb6dc92c9c06a881c9eb616abf785cd01c", "ja": "何度もオーディションに落ちて、悔しくて……。\nその時の涙を思い出せば、できるんじゃないかって！", "zh": "一次次落选，真的很不甘心……\n只要想起那时流下的眼泪，我觉得应该就能做到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c4ccc708be9ff42daeb288b474464c19ef620ff2b208254be6b8cd2e35a192f4", "ja": "なるほど……。\nでも本番で思い出すには、辛い内容じゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……  \n不过，要在正式演出时回想起来，这内容不会太痛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "fd89739a6b242bcd08426476000573473e9b5f58e981134d3e678331bbb02893", "ja": "ああ！　違うんです、{$P$}！\n思い出すのは、悔し涙だけじゃありません！", "zh": "啊！不是这样的，{$P$}！\n要回忆的，可不只有不甘的泪水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "99baecd829ce18526d1e8314bf41e0011cbf564b2fc7a6cd3a1b2e9155116278", "ja": "アイドルになった後は、感動したり、\n嬉しくて泣いたりすることの方が多くて。", "zh": "成为偶像之后，更多的是因为感动，或是开心得流泪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1014_p", "source_sha256": "facc23022c8f13b7d54703fb2139792197bb3688969eed356c9652b0cfcdff81", "ja": "ははっ。そういえば、\n感極まってる紗代子を何度か見た記憶があるな。", "zh": "哈哈。说起来，我记得好几次看到紗代子感动得热泪盈眶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "515ec85aa1d7e5e23776c876b397a6935391eaa6935e0f0adfe3652875ff080f", "ja": "えっ！？　私、そんなに泣いてましたか？　けど……\nそれは全部、{$P$}のせいですよ。", "zh": "诶！？我哭得那么厉害吗？不过……\n这一切全都要怪{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "71df185c07c5a2e1e015d3256fd2d1f3c16145b78ede932a6cbf26b8228c2b42", "ja": "{$P$}が、アイドルにしてくれたから\n色々な涙を流せるようになったんです。", "zh": "因为{$P$}让我成为了偶像，我才能流下各种各样的泪水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2a7cb866e8be77db2c897dc15c049708c0a00f45791118a86d8c4ec6cc9aa80f", "ja": "紗代子……。そう言ってもらえて嬉しいよ。\nじゃあ、今から流す涙は……。", "zh": "纱代子……。你能这么说，我很高兴。那现在要流的眼泪是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "81724a2cfd2b355cb1a21b60cdc519843e5d50226ea3b52a64946a622d41c4c5", "ja": "はい！　悔しかったこと、嬉しかったこと……\nこれまでの私がたくさん詰まった、最高の涙です！", "zh": "是的！有过不甘，也有过喜悦……这是饱含着一路走来的我的点点滴滴，最棒的眼泪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7ad1e3472bd1a551a6933028144fdbb2883eb3df51802fc9d249e539d1c8b88d", "ja": "ああ。紗代子の気持ちはわかった。\nそれじゃ、目薬は無しでいこう！", "zh": "啊，我明白纱代子的心情了。\n那就不用眼药水了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "b72bfb255a19ebb40a6590242cbf5936971046ff73b3143ff19a4daf647c8798", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします！\nそうだ。あと、ひとつだけお願いがあって……。", "zh": "好的，请多关照！\n对了，我还有一个请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "4eecf7503f645bd281733dedbcecc6ebda46e3fa99e300a146a4c557bb5d582c", "ja": "その……次のシーン、見ていてほしいんです。\nPVを見る人に、私の思いが届くかどうか……。", "zh": "那个……我希望您能看看接下来的场景。\n不知道我的心意，能不能传达给观看PV的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0354_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e4bde49434953b960ff0d53668aaa471397fbf4c1627118e89db2128a65edf0f", "ja": "（本番がはじまると、紗代子は美しい涙を流した。\n今までの彼女の歩みを、映し出すように……）", "zh": "（正式拍摄开始后，纱代子流下了美丽的泪水。\n仿佛映照出了她一路走来的历程……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
